{
  "about": "Meshpool Auto: which agent gets a new task. Each category lists keywords and, per agent, a benchmark quality score from 0 to 100 (the solve rate where measured) and, where measured, cost_usd and seconds per solved task. Auto takes the best quality among the agents that are installed and signed in, treats every agent within quality_band points of it as equally good, and among those picks the cheapest, then the fastest. The source field says where each number came from.",
